But wait: initial boot sets store.open[first.id] = true. When user completes S1 (reversible), I set store.open[s.id] = undefined... Actually in completeStep I don't reset open. In executeFromGate I do `store.open[s.id] = undefined`. Inconsistent — in completeStep, S1 remains open=true (done and open). It's fine visually (done steps can stay expanded showing outcome + rollback). But then the next current S2 has open undefined → auto-expands. OK both fine.

Edge: current step highlighted but collapsed (user collapsed it) — "Up next" badge still on it. Fine.

