Another check — `closeGate` focuses `.step.is-current .step-row` — could be null-safe (it is, with if).

In `executeFromGate` and `completeStep`, after render() we scrollCurrent. Good.

`escapeHtml(s.detail)` — detail items are plain strings I authored; I inject them without escaping (d contains no HTML except none). They're trusted data. Fine, though they contain things like `kubectl rollout status...` — no angle brackets. OK.

